{
  "id": "283",
  "title": "Who's Afraid of Whom",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2017-04-08",
  "synopsis": "Chinese calligraphy on the wall is sometimes read from left to right, and sometimes from right to left. Which one do you prefer?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/386/51d33aad627ca2cc4f3b1f566d7ac244dad436b0.mp3?1491244449",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "谁怕谁\n\n    小明家里有一张书法，上面写着：太太怕我。他的爸爸妈妈把这张书法挂在墙上。他们都很喜欢这张书法。\n    爸爸喜欢把这张书法从左边开始读，读成：太太怕我；妈妈喜欢从右边开始读，读成：我怕太太。所以，从左边读，爸爸很高兴，从右边读，妈妈很高兴。",
    "traditional": "誰怕誰\n\n    小明家裡有一張書法，上面寫著：太太怕我。他的爸爸媽媽把這張書法掛在牆上。他們都很喜歡這張書法。\n    爸爸喜歡把這張書法從左邊開始讀，讀成：太太怕我；媽媽喜歡從右邊開始讀，讀成：我怕太太。所以，從左邊讀，爸爸很高興，從右邊讀，媽媽很高興。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Who's Afraid of Whom"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明家里有一张书法，上面写着：太太怕我。",
      "traditional": "小明家裡有一張書法，上面寫著：太太怕我。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng jiā lǐ yǒu yì zhāng shū fǎ shàng miàn xiě zhe tài tai pà wǒ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "他的爸爸妈妈把这张书法挂在墙上。",
      "traditional": "他的爸爸媽媽把這張書法掛在牆上。",
      "pinyin": "tā de bà ba mā ma bǎ zhè zhāng shū fǎ guà zài qiáng shang",
      "english": "In Little Ming's house there's a calligraphy that says: “The wife fears me”."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "他们都很喜欢这张书法。",
      "traditional": "他們都很喜歡這張書法。",
      "pinyin": "tā men dōu hěn xǐ huan zhè zhāng shū fǎ",
      "english": "His dad and mom put this calligraphy up on the wall."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "They both really like this calligraphy."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "爸爸喜欢把这张书法从左边开始读，读成：太太怕我；",
      "traditional": "爸爸喜歡把這張書法從左邊開始讀，讀成：太太怕我；",
      "pinyin": "bà ba xǐ huan bǎ zhè zhāng shū fǎ cóng zuǒ bian kāi shǐ dú dú chéng tài tai pà wǒ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "妈妈喜欢从右边开始读，读成：我怕太太。",
      "traditional": "媽媽喜歡從右邊開始讀，讀成：我怕太太。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma xǐ huan cóng yòu bian kāi shǐ dú dú chéng wǒ pà tài tai",
      "english": "Dad likes to read the calligraphy starting from the left, so it becomes: “The wife fears me”."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "所以，从左边读，爸爸很高兴，从右边读，妈妈很高兴。",
      "traditional": "所以，從左邊讀，爸爸很高興，從右邊讀，媽媽很高興。",
      "pinyin": "suǒ yǐ cóng zuǒ bian dú bà ba hěn gāo xìng cóng yòu bian dú mā ma hěn gāo xìng",
      "english": "Mom likes to read the calligraphy starting from the right, making it: “I fear my wife”."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "So dad is happy when reading it from the left, and mom is happy when reading it from the right."
    }
  ],
